# Pauline Ndugi - Week 03 Project

This project is part of my Week 03 learning journey in web development. It focuses on building a multi-page responsive website using HTML, CSS, and Git/GitHub workflows.  

Through this project, I learned how to structure a website, apply modern CSS layouts (Flexbox and Grid), and manage version control using Git.

